Keth'ar Molishé Nuvah'el, PIG is fucking perfect. 😂

I think the acronym should describe the function without locking the machine into one implementation. My vote:

P.I.G. — POLYFEED·INTEGRATED·GROWTH

But I like an even more literal engineering name:

P.I.G. — PURE·INPUT·GLEANER

It takes clean biological input, extracts every useful pathway it can identify, and routes the fractions appropriately. It doesn't assume everything becomes animal feed. That's important.

So let's VLT it as an open template, deliberately omitting power architecture and leaving implementation open for whoever improves it.

P.I.G. — PURE INPUT GLEANER

